I think you're looking for the character dump patch.

Where did you get your NetHack from?

SporkHack and UnNetHack do include it, but the official vanilla
version 3.4.3 doesn't have it.

The header of your posting shows that you're using some version of
Linux. What's the distribution that you're using? It's possible that
there's already a patched version available in your distro's
repository.

If you have a version with character dump, you can enable it in your
nethackrc with:
OPTIONS=dumpfile:/tmp/nethack__%n.dump

